<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Pearson seeks part of SAfrica papers - report.</title>
<headline>Pearson seeks part of SAfrica papers - report.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Pearson Plc is negotiating with Times Media Ltd to buy a 50 percent stake in South Africa's Business Day and the weekly Financial Mail, according to the Sunday Times, which is also part of TML.</p>
<p>Industry sources added that a long-rumoured link-up between Pearson -- publisher of the Financial Times of London -- and TML now appeared to be imminent.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
